    "sub_name": "中國文學史(二)",
    "sub_ename": "HISTORY OF CHINESE LITERATURE(2)",
    "describe_ch": "中國文學史著重探討源流、評介作家。修習本課程期對中國文學之流變及重要作家之作品特色與生平遭遇，能有相當深度的認識。",
    "describe_eh": "The course focuses on the studying of the origin of Chinese literature and making comments on the authors. By taking this course, the students will be able to have an in-depth understanding of the development of Chinese literature and the characteristic of the literary works by important writers.",
